A bunch of other people
did too, but I won $250,000.

57
00:05:46,213 --> 00:05:49,615
Two-hundred and fifty thou...

58
00:05:50,183 --> 00:05:52,880
Well, that's how you got that.
- Yeah.

59
00:05:53,053 --> 00:05:56,080
Oh. Well, what are
you gonna do now?

60
