No, you don't have to do that.

104
00:08:36,983 --> 00:08:41,284
Here. You must be freezing.
Let me put this on you. I'm sorry.

105
00:08:42,655 --> 00:08:44,749
You really are
sorry, aren't you?

106
00:08:44,924 --> 00:08:48,452
I'm very sorry.
And your watch...

107
