111
00:09:05,111 --> 00:09:08,343
I'm Billy Wheeler. I'm
kind of from out of town.

112
00:09:08,515 --> 00:09:11,644
But I'm gonna stay here in
Atlanta until I bring you your watch.

113
00:09:11,818 --> 00:09:15,778
- I'm real sorry.
- And how do I get ahold of you?

114
00:09:16,289 --> 00:09:18,451
Oh. Um...

115
00:09:18,892 --> 00:09:21,919
I'll tell you what, I'll go
rent a place right now

116
00:09:22,095 --> 00:09:24,462
and then I'll call you
with my phone number.

117
00:09:24,631 --> 00:09:28,898
Or, if you'll have dinner
with me, I'll give it to you then.

118
00:09:29,869 --> 00:09:32,805
I'd love to. But I can't.

119
00:09:32,972 --> 00:09:35,840
I have a business
meeting, after I change.

120
00:09:36,810 --> 00:09:39,302
So you'll call me, and you'll
let me know where you are?

121
00:09:39,479 --> 00:09:40,503
You bet.

122
00:09:42,148 --> 00:09:44,117
- Bye-bye.
- Bye.

123
00:10:04,938 --> 00:10:05,962
Hi.

124
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,502
Hi.

125
00:10:10,477 --> 00:10:12,708
- They couldn't fix your watch.
- Oh.

126
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:16,839
- So I got one to replace it.
- Oh.

127
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:19,214
Oh, Billy.

128
00:10:20,487 --> 00:10:23,980
"To Judy Wilson
from Billy Wheeler."

129
